The secure connection verifies and works.

164
00:08:19,461 --> 00:08:21,893
Your three diagnoses match the evidence.

165
00:08:22,443 --> 00:08:23,744
To pass, all five.

166
00:08:25,794 --> 00:08:27,565
Your turn, on your own machine.

